  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.CkFlagSum.main | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.CkFlagSum.main | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.CkFlagSum.main <;> assumption)
